{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜防範資料外洩(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-25-13-24-47KL9861tR.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：防範資料外洩</p><p>近期本港發生連串資料外洩事件，受影響行業包括航空公司、零售業及虛擬保險公司等，企業如何防範資料外洩？市民應怎樣應對？</p><p>嘉賓：電腦保安專家賴灼東</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.451608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T10:17:30.430825+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:25.186330+00:00","content_hash":"5d5177a2a5c1cfe0c54aa6ff50e9ed1a9858f1da94e922a4fbc0948a741d3eb7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}